<title>UK: BAA handles 6.7 pct more cargo in April.</title>
<headline>BAA handles 6.7 pct more cargo in April.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo handled last month at BAA's seven UK airports at 125,328 tonnes was was 6.7 percent above the level in April last year, BAA's April traffic statistics show.</p>
<p>The number of air transport movements rose by 4.4 percent.</p>
